// Local code-signing — your free Apple ID's "Personal Team".
//
// Fill DEVELOPMENT_TEAM with your 10-character Team ID, found in:
//   Xcode ▸ Settings ▸ Accounts ▸ (your Apple ID) ▸ pick the
//   "(Personal Team)" row — the Team ID is shown beside it.
// Or run:  ./scripts/team-id.sh   (after adding the account in Xcode)
//
// This file is committed with an EMPTY value so `xcodegen generate`
// never fails. After you fill it, keep your Team ID out of git with:
//   git update-index --skip-worktree Signing.xcconfig
//
// Simulator builds (CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO) ignore this entirely;
// only on-device builds need a Team.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
